## Why This Is Asked
Assesses ability to architect multi-tenant isolation in a serverless, multi-region setup with automated validation, governance, and DR.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant resource isolation (DynamoDB tables, Lambda aliases)
- Per-branch previews and feature flags
- Cross-region traffic routing (Route 53 latency-based)
- Automated rollback via AWS Config & IAM Access Analyzer
- DR with DynamoDB Global Tables and cross-region Lambda failover

